+# Cafe scene style generation prompts
+
+Generated with the built-in image generation tool. Every image uses `base.png` as its composition and identity reference. Final images are converted to PNG and resized to 1024×1024 with sips.
+
+## 01-studio-ghibli.png
+
+Use case: style-transfer. Create ONE separate 1024x1024 square illustration based on the provided cafe photograph. Input image is the reference for the exact character identity, pose, composition, object placement and framing.
+Target style: Studio Ghibli anime film still, fully hand-drawn character animation with gentle cel shading and fine expressive drawing, soft hand-painted watercolor cafe backgrounds, warm nostalgic window light. Fully reinterpret every element through that animation medium, never a filter over a photograph.
+Preserve the same young adult woman, curly auburn shoulder-length hair with voluminous ringlets, freckles across nose and cheeks, round tortoiseshell glasses, gentle closed-mouth smile, mustard-yellow chunky knit sweater with rolled sleeves. Seated centered slightly right in a three-quarter view looking left out the window; she holds the small off-white speckled ceramic coffee cup at chest height with BOTH hands, same hand pose and bent elbows. Keep her face recognizable within the anime stylization.
+Preserve square medium portrait composition: tall cafe window at left, softly rendered street beyond, green leafy potted plant on the lower-left wooden tabletop, golden croissant on round ceramic plate in lower right, wood table spanning foreground, softly painted warm cafe interior and background patron on right, tiny warm hanging lamps. Retain original relative scale and framing of woman, cup, plant and croissant. No text, captions, signatures, logos or watermarks. Single image, no collage.
+
+## 02-simpsons.png
+
+Use case: style-transfer. Create ONE separate square 1024x1024 image. The provided cafe photo is the reference for character identity, pose, exact composition, framing, and object placement.
+Preserve this woman's identity: curly auburn shoulder-length hair in voluminous ringlets, freckles across nose and cheeks, round tortoiseshell glasses, gentle closed-mouth smile, mustard-yellow chunky knit sweater with rolled sleeves. She is seated centered slightly right in three-quarter view, face and eyes turned left looking out the window. She holds the small off-white speckled ceramic coffee cup at chest height with BOTH hands in the same pose, elbows bent and resting near the tabletop.
+Retain square medium portrait composition: tall cafe window at left with street visible beyond, green leafy potted plant at lower left on the wood table, golden croissant on round ceramic plate at lower right, horizontal wood table across foreground, cafe interior with an understated background patron at right and small hanging lights. Keep the relative positions, scale and framing of woman, cup, plant and croissant. Translate all elements fully into the target medium, including the background. No photographic substrate or filter effect. No text, captions, lettering, signatures, logos or watermarks. No collage.
+Target style: The Simpsons cartoon style. Fully commit to the television animation design language: bright yellow skin, distinctive projecting rounded upper-lip overbite, big round white eyes with simple black pupils visible behind round tortoiseshell glasses, thick consistent clean black outlines, simple flat bright colors, extremely limited flat cel shadows. Simplify the auburn curls into graphic rounded zigzag and scalloped curl shapes, retain brown freckles. Flat mustard sweater with stylized sparse knit marks. Draw all props and the cafe background in the same bold flat cartoon language. This is the reference woman transformed into a Simpsons guest character, preserving her individual hairstyle, glasses, freckles and clothing; don't replace her with an existing character.
+
+## 03-art-nouveau.png
+
+Use case: style-transfer. Create ONE separate square 1024x1024 image. The provided cafe photo is the reference for character identity, pose, exact composition, framing, and object placement.
+Preserve this woman's identity: curly auburn shoulder-length hair in voluminous ringlets, freckles across nose and cheeks, round tortoiseshell glasses, gentle closed-mouth smile, mustard-yellow chunky knit sweater with rolled sleeves. She is seated centered slightly right in three-quarter view, face and eyes turned left looking out the window. She holds the small off-white speckled ceramic coffee cup at chest height with BOTH hands in the same pose, elbows bent and resting near the tabletop.
+Retain square medium portrait composition: tall cafe window at left with street visible beyond, green leafy potted plant at lower left on the wood table, golden croissant on round ceramic plate at lower right, horizontal wood table across foreground, cafe interior with an understated background patron at right and small hanging lights. Keep the relative positions, scale and framing of woman, cup, plant and croissant. Translate all elements fully into the target medium, including the background. No photographic substrate or filter effect. No text, captions, lettering, signatures, logos or watermarks. No collage.
+Target style: Art Nouveau poster in the style of Alphonse Mucha. Completely redrawn as an elegant turn-of-the-century color lithograph, with flowing organic lines, refined sinuous ink contours, flattened decorative shapes, muted pastel sage, dusty rose, ivory, ochre and auburn palette. Her auburn curls become beautifully interlocking organic ribbons. Add a decorative floral halo frame behind the woman's head and a graceful botanical ornamental border around the square, integrating the original window/cafe and tabletop objects without changing the pose or hiding them. Floral scrollwork and ornamental line work, delicate flat layered lithographic color, subtly textured paper, elegant figure drawing. Sweater remains mustard knit, glasses remain round tortoiseshell, and freckles remain visible. Keep the poster completely free of lettering or any text.
+
+## 04-picasso-cubism.png
+
+Use case: style-transfer. Create ONE separate square 1024x1024 image. The provided cafe photo is the reference for character identity, pose, exact composition, framing, and object placement.
+Preserve this woman's identity: curly auburn shoulder-length hair in voluminous ringlets, freckles across nose and cheeks, round tortoiseshell glasses, gentle closed-mouth smile, mustard-yellow chunky knit sweater with rolled sleeves. She is seated centered slightly right in three-quarter view, face and eyes turned left looking out the window. She holds the small off-white speckled ceramic coffee cup at chest height with BOTH hands in the same pose, elbows bent and resting near the tabletop.
+Retain square medium portrait composition: tall cafe window at left with street visible beyond, green leafy potted plant at lower left on the wood table, golden croissant on round ceramic plate at lower right, horizontal wood table across foreground, cafe interior with an understated background patron at right and small hanging lights. Keep the relative positions, scale and framing of woman, cup, plant and croissant. Translate all elements fully into the target medium, including the background. No photographic substrate or filter effect. No text, captions, lettering, signatures, logos or watermarks. No collage.
+Target style: Analytic/synthetic Cubism in the manner of Pablo Picasso, a fully realized bold oil painting. Radically reconstruct the entire scene in fragmented overlapping geometric planes, angular interlocking shapes, compressed pictorial space, multiple viewpoints simultaneously visible in the face and cup. The woman's face combines profile and frontal viewpoints, eyes and nose deliberately displaced across faceted planes, round tortoiseshell eyeglasses split into recognizable circles, freckles retained as small dotted marks. Auburn curls become spiral fragments and angular dark reddish-brown arcs around the face. Mustard knit sweater becomes ochre/yellow planes with rhythmic linear knit motifs. Coffee cup, BOTH hands, potted plant and croissant are recognizable yet faceted and angular. Bold painterly oil strokes, scraped paint, strong dark contours, warm ochres, umbers, cream, slate-blue and restrained green. Retain the broad original placement and visual hierarchy while completely committing to cubist geometry and multiple viewpoints; absolutely no realistic face or photographic forms underneath a surface treatment.
+
+## 05-watercolor-sketch.png
+
+Use case: style-transfer. Create ONE separate square 1024x1024 image. The provided cafe photo is the reference for character identity, pose, exact composition, framing, and object placement.
+Preserve this woman's identity: curly auburn shoulder-length hair in voluminous ringlets, freckles across nose and cheeks, round tortoiseshell glasses, gentle closed-mouth smile, mustard-yellow chunky knit sweater with rolled sleeves. She is seated centered slightly right in three-quarter view, face and eyes turned left looking out the window. She holds the small off-white speckled ceramic coffee cup at chest height with BOTH hands in the same pose, elbows bent and resting near the tabletop.
+Retain square medium portrait composition: tall cafe window at left with street visible beyond, green leafy potted plant at lower left on the wood table, golden croissant on round ceramic plate at lower right, horizontal wood table across foreground, cafe interior with an understated background patron at right and small hanging lights. Keep the relative positions, scale and framing of woman, cup, plant and croissant. Translate all elements fully into the target medium, including the background. No photographic substrate or filter effect. No text, captions, lettering, signatures, logos or watermarks. No collage.
+Target style: loose watercolor sketch on textured white watercolor paper, completely redrawn with visible lively graphite pencil underdrawing. Loose expressive pencil contours, gestural broken line work and soft transparent wet-on-wet washes, blooms, pigment granulation, colors bleeding into each other and the white paper, a few spontaneous paint splatters. Preserve large untouched white areas, unfinished edges and incomplete background suggestions. Auburn ringlets described by loose pencil loops and sienna washes, delicate facial freckles and round tortoiseshell glasses crisply suggested within a sensitively sketched face, mustard knit sweater with airy yellow ochre washes and sparse pencil hatching. Pale blue gray window and softly suggested cafe, green plant and golden croissant clearly recognizable in original positions. Both hands around the cup drawn with graceful loose contour lines. Human hand-painted sketchbook work, not a photoreal portrait or digital watercolor filter; retain the loose unfinished quality across the whole image.
+
+## 06-van-gogh.png
+
+Use case: style-transfer. Create ONE separate square 1024x1024 image. The provided cafe photo is the reference for character identity, pose, exact composition, framing, and object placement.
+Preserve this woman's identity: curly auburn shoulder-length hair in voluminous ringlets, freckles across nose and cheeks, round tortoiseshell glasses, gentle closed-mouth smile, mustard-yellow chunky knit sweater with rolled sleeves. She is seated centered slightly right in three-quarter view, face and eyes turned left looking out the window. She holds the small off-white speckled ceramic coffee cup at chest height with BOTH hands in the same pose, elbows bent and resting near the tabletop.
+Retain square medium portrait composition: tall cafe window at left with street visible beyond, green leafy potted plant at lower left on the wood table, golden croissant on round ceramic plate at lower right, horizontal wood table across foreground, cafe interior with an understated background patron at right and small hanging lights. Keep the relative positions, scale and framing of woman, cup, plant and croissant. Translate all elements fully into the target medium, including the background. No photographic substrate or filter effect. No text, captions, lettering, signatures, logos or watermarks. No collage.
+Target style: Post-Impressionist oil painting in the manner of Vincent van Gogh. Thick sculptural impasto paint everywhere, vivid yellows and cobalt/ultramarine blues, swirling expressive directional brushstrokes, emphatic painted contours and rhythmic dashes. The cafe window and background ripple with animated blue and golden strokes. Auburn hair built from curling copper, sienna and dark umber paint strokes, face carefully recognizable but boldly constructed from visible peach, ochre and cool blue-green strokes; freckles visible as small painted flecks and round tortoiseshell glasses as curved dark painted contours. Mustard sweater is radiant yellow ochre with dense directional impasto marks articulating the knit. Both hands around the cup are painted with expressive deliberate brushwork. Plant leaves shaped from thick green strokes, croissant built from golden curved ridges on blue-shadowed plate, wooden table formed of long energetic warm brushstrokes. Entire artwork must read as an original vigorously hand-painted oil painting, with no photographic skin, no smoothly rendered realism and no filter overlay. Keep the warm daylight scene and all object positions.
+

